==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*3 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Lione Hippoe]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

