==Strategy==
This stage can easily be beaten by using [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] to quickly take out the initial Hippoes and destroy the base before the Metal Hippoe spawns.

